  "quotes": [
    {
      "gene": "ACIAD/ACIAD3523",
      "reference": "PMID:18319726",
      "supporting_text": "the metE mutant, obtained in presence of coenzyme-B12, is auxotrophic for methionine.",
      "source_sha256": "b25a9f78e0a60cf3acdf5c8d7e59547b82b2757989f16c332010d0f0c7bdc6bc"
    },
    {
      "gene": "ACIAD/ACIAD3523",
      "reference": "PMID:18840283",
      "supporting_text": "Since coenzyme-B12 is neither synthesized by A. baylyi nor provided in the experimental media, the \u0394ACIAD3523 mutant was unable to use the MetH enzyme to synthesize methionine.",
      "source_sha256": "f2b6c9351973f264205ca798aa31b7bfe2f4b54eebfb520d2364f260e6cf7f17"
    },
    {
      "gene": "ACIAD/ACIAD3523",
      "reference": "PMID:33534785",
      "supporting_text": "ACIAD3523 (UniProt:Q6F6Z8) is required for methionine synthesis in the absence of cobalamin, and so is the adjacent gene ACIAD3524.",
      "source_sha256": "67df796919d576b05d4fcce094273d783513409b3a7f84d26d5b539e75753612"
    },
    {
      "gene": "ACIAD/ACIAD3523",
      "reference": "PMID:33534785",
      "supporting_text": "ACIAD3523 lacks the N-terminal folate-binding domain",
      "source_sha256": "67df796919d576b05d4fcce094273d783513409b3a7f84d26d5b539e75753612"
    },
    {
      "gene": "ACIAD/ACIAD3523",
      "reference": "PMID:33534785",
      "supporting_text": "The zinc-binding residues are highly conserved in the MesA, MesB, and MesD families (Fig 4).",
      "source_sha256": "67df796919d576b05d4fcce094273d783513409b3a7f84d26d5b539e75753612"
    },
    {
      "gene": "ACIAD/ACIAD3523",
      "reference": "PMID:33534785",
      "supporting_text": "We will call these proteins MesD and MesX.",
      "source_sha256": "67df796919d576b05d4fcce094273d783513409b3a7f84d26d5b539e75753612"
    },
    {
      "gene": "ACIAD/ACIAD3523",
      "reference": "file:ACIAD/ACIAD3523/ACIAD3523-uniprot.txt",
      "supporting_text": "DR   InterPro; IPR016456; Met_Synthase_cat.",
      "source_sha256": "2318c467418b9b8eaede5f1208e7cf47f89fe325af4c6148a2ca85cd06246833"
    },
    {
      "gene": "ACIAD/ACIAD3523",
      "reference": "file:ACIAD/ACIAD3523/ACIAD3523-uniprot.txt",
      "supporting_text": "DR   Pfam; PF01717; Meth_synt_2; 1.",
      "source_sha256": "2318c467418b9b8eaede5f1208e7cf47f89fe325af4c6148a2ca85cd06246833"
    },
    {
      "gene": "ACIAD/ACIAD3524",
      "reference": "PMID:18319726",
      "supporting_text": "We have shown that the ACIAD3524 mutant is auxotrophic for methionine, whereas prototrophy is restored by complementation with ACIAD3524.",
      "source_sha256": "b25a9f78e0a60cf3acdf5c8d7e59547b82b2757989f16c332010d0f0c7bdc6bc"
    },
    {
      "gene": "ACIAD/ACIAD3524",
      "reference": "PMID:33534785",
      "supporting_text": "Instead, we predict that MesX provides methyl groups to MesD, either by covalently binding the methyl group, or by forming a methylated substrate that MesD can act on.",
      "source_sha256": "67df796919d576b05d4fcce094273d783513409b3a7f84d26d5b539e75753612"
    },
    {
      "gene": "ACIAD/ACIAD3524",
      "reference": "file:ACIAD/ACIAD3524/ACIAD3524-uniprot.txt",
      "supporting_text": "DR   InterPro; IPR015004; MesX.",
      "source_sha256": "4004a305c6359bc7c4167aade20971dfc4c03d434559cd7809e48e70f656e977"
    },
    {
      "gene": "DEHMC/cbdbA481",
      "reference": "PMID:32034217",
      "supporting_text": "No L-methionine was formed in the presence of core-MetECBDB",
      "source_sha256": "8d225c5d3a3a9187f6e9ee858b3a7a9d6eeec53ddb102304337778bf81ad1224"
    },
    {
      "gene": "DEHMC/cbdbA481",
      "reference": "PMID:32034217",
      "supporting_text": "The enzymatic activity of purified core-MetECBDB was tested using methylcob(III)alamin as methyl donor and homocysteine as methyl acceptor.",
      "source_sha256": "8d225c5d3a3a9187f6e9ee858b3a7a9d6eeec53ddb102304337778bf81ad1224"
    },
    {
      "gene": "DEHMC/cbdbA481",
      "reference": "PMID:32034217",
      "supporting_text": "We speculate that the methyl group is directly transferred from the CoFeSP to the core-MetECBDB",
      "source_sha256": "8d225c5d3a3a9187f6e9ee858b3a7a9d6eeec53ddb102304337778bf81ad1224"
    },
    {
      "gene": "DEHMC/cbdbA481",
      "reference": "PMID:32034217",
      "supporting_text": "the formation of methionine ([M\u2009+\u2009H]+ \u2009=\u2009150.0583\u2009m/z) during the enzymatic reaction was verified via liquid chromatography-mass spectrometry (LC-MS)",
      "source_sha256": "8d225c5d3a3a9187f6e9ee858b3a7a9d6eeec53ddb102304337778bf81ad1224"
    },
    {
      "gene": "DEHMC/cbdbA481",
      "reference": "PMID:33534785",
      "supporting_text": "MesB uses methylcobalamin, but not 5-methyl-THF, as a substrate in vitro",
      "source_sha256": "67df796919d576b05d4fcce094273d783513409b3a7f84d26d5b539e75753612"
    },
    {
      "gene": "DEHMC/cbdbA481",
      "reference": "file:DEHMC/cbdbA481/cbdbA481-uniprot.txt",
      "supporting_text": "DR   EMBL; AJ965256; CAI82680.1; -; Genomic_DNA.",
      "source_sha256": "3756f355e56575fcc83d2f07fe2a3cff43a1d81c80bb085f05a6c156b3277b68"
    }
  ],
